# Fabrica project workflow

Core rules via cxado `make rules-link`: `core-*.mdc`.

## Scope

- CI/CD templates, gates, profiles (`templates/`, `config/`, `scripts/adopt.sh`)
- Docs phases P0–F3; references via `refs/` symlink
- Mirror GitLab and GitHub job contracts (SARIF, exit codes)

## Before finishing

1. One todo = one PR, ≤5 files changed
2. `warn → block` in a separate micro-PR
3. Dev skills: `make skills-link` from cxado meta-repo (do not commit `.agents/skills/`)
